@startuml
title Produktionslinie - Flow Diagram

actor Operator

node "Raw Material Warehouse" as Raw
queue "Buffer1" as B1
node "Machine Fraese1" as M1
queue "Buffer2" as B2
node "Machine Drehbank1" as M2
queue "Buffer3" as B3
node "Machine Bohrmaschine1" as M3
node "Machine Schleifmaschine1" as M4
node "Finished Goods Warehouse" as Finished

Operator --> Raw : liefert Rohmaterial
Raw --> M1 : Material entnommen
M1 --> B1 : semi-finished
B1 --> M2 : liefert
M2 --> B2 : semi-finished
B2 --> M3 : liefert
M3 --> B3 : semi-finished
B3 --> M4 : liefert
M4 --> Finished : fertige Teile

note right of M1
  - cycle_time
  - error_rate
  - status
end note

note left of B1
  - capacity
  - fill_level
  - overflow/starvation
end note

@enduml

